# Software Architecture

## Project: Smart Team Task Manager

### 1. Architecture Overview

The Smart Team Task Manager uses a three-layer architecture.

### 2. System Layers

#### Front-End
The user interface. Users interact with the application through this layer.

#### Back-End
Processes user requests, applies application logic, and provides REST API endpoints.

#### Database
Stores application data, including users and tasks.

### 3. Communication Flow

User → Front-End → REST API → Back-End → Database

### 4. Architecture Type

The proposed architecture is a Modular Monolith.

The application runs as a single backend, but its responsibilities are separated into independent modules.

### 5. Main Modules

- Users Module
- Tasks Module
- Authentication Module
